[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_10200100_12_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_10200100_12_0010","text":"（……好奇怪\n　平时我不会这么紧张的……）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_10200100_12_0020","text":"灯织！\n你好像很紧张呢……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_10200100_12_0030","text":"……嘛，有点"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_10200100_12_0040","text":"不要太绷着啦\n来，握紧手……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_10200100_12_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_10200100_12_0050","text":"所以说这种事不用……\n──……巡？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_10200100_12_0060","text":"……呐，灯织。再这样待一会儿吧\n嘿嘿……其实，我也在紧张呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_10200100_12_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_10200100_12_0070","text":"……巡也会有这样的表情啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_10200100_12_0080","text":"我自己也挺惊讶的\n今天好像有点特别……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_10200100_12_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_10200100_12_0090","text":"来，一起深呼吸吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_10200100_12_0100","text":"……嗯"}]
